  "an8.45:0.3": "Bojjhā ",
  "an8.45:1.1": "On one occasion the Blessed One was dwelling at Sāvatthī at Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s Park. ",
  "an8.45:1.2": "Then the female lay follower Bojjhā approached the Blessed One, paid homage to him, and sat down to one side. The Blessed One then said to her: ",
  "an8.45:2.1": "“Bojjhā, observed complete in eight factors, the uposatha is of great fruit and benefit, extraordinarily brilliant and pervasive….” ",
  "an8.45:2.2": "All as in <a href=\"https://suttacentral.net/an8.42\">AN8.42</a>, including the verses. [261–62] ",
